","wpu":"Castro fortress","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/CastroFortress.jpg/960px-CastroFortress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Samil Beach","g":"sights","k":"landmark","la":42.21,"lo":-8.776389,"d":5521,"ds":"Samil Beach (Galician: Praia de Samil, Spanish: Playa de Samil) is a beach in the parish of Navia, Vigo, Galicia, north-west Spain. At 1,250 metres (4,100 ft) in length and approximately 60 metres wide, it is the largest beach in the city. The Cíes Islands, part of the Atlantic Islands of Galicia National Park, are visible from the shore and act as a natural barrier that shelters the bay from open Atlantic swells.","wpu":"Samil Beach","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Playa_samil.jpg/960px-Playa_samil.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Rande Bridge","g":"sights","k":"landmark","la":42.28808,"lo":-8.66051,"d":7396,"ds":"The Rande Bridge (Galician: Ponte de Rande, Spanish: Puente de Rande) is a cable-stayed bridge 9 kilometres from the city of Vigo and 18 kilometres from the city of Pontevedra, in the Province of Pontevedra, Spain. It spans Vigo bay across the Rande Strait, linking the municipalities of Redondela and Moaña.","wpu":"Rande Bridge","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Puente_de_rande.jpg/960px-Puente_de_rande.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"}],"about":{"ds":"Vigo (Galician: [ˈbiɣʊ], locally [ˈbiħʊ]) is a city and municipality, the capital of the comarca of Vigo in the province of Pontevedra in the autonomous community of Galicia, in Spain. Located in the northwest of the Iberian Peninsula, it sits on the southern shore of an inlet of the Atlantic Ocean, the Ria de Vigo, the southernmost of the Rías Baixas. The municipality, with an area of 109.06 km2 (42.11 sq mi) and a population of 295,523 in 2024 including rural parishes, is the most populous municipality in Galicia, and the 14th-most-populous in Spain.","wpu":"Vigo","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Pazo_Qui%C3%B1ones_de_Le%C3%B3n%2C_Castrelos_edited.jpg/960px-Pazo_Qui%C3%B1ones_de_Le%C3%B3n%2C_Castrelos_edited.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},"wk":"2026-10-18"}